    intro: "Daniel served several kings in a foreign land. His enemies searched for a charge against him but could find none, because he was faithful and no error or fault was found in him. Whatever our job or school, we can serve in such a way that our character is noticed. Paul says, whatever you do, work heartily, as for the Lord and not for men. Work is a place for the Spirit's fruit.",
